{"id":"mentira","lemma":"mentira","pos":"noun","rank":877,"glosses":["lie, trick, falsity"],"ipa":"/menˈtiɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mentiras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-mentira.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es una mentira piadosa.","en":"It is a white lie.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/163055"},{"text":"Él no dice mentiras.","en":"He doesn't tell lies.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453402"},{"text":"Eso es totalmente mentira.","en":"That's a total lie.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/929674"},{"text":"No digas mentiras. Sé honesto.","en":"Don't lie. Be honest.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70094"},{"text":"¿Cuándo dije una mentira?","en":"When have I told a lie?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589693"}]}